name sam-emcon-hold-1
timeout 160

# EMCON IS A RECEIVER, NOT A CLOCK. doc/modules/ground/module.md §Knowledge 5.
#
# `set emcon hold` means the position's sets stay UNPOWERED until its own PASSIVE receiver hears an
# airborne emitter. A timer would work and would tell the truth about nothing; a range trigger on the
# unit registry is the read the whole architecture exists to prevent. What is left is the only honest
# cue: something the position MEASURED.
#
# TWO AIRCRAFT, one line apart. `loud` runs in with its fire-control radar in CRM; `quiet` runs in with
# it off, 8 km to the east on the identical profile. The position hears the first, comes up, and works
# it. It never hears the second — and a `quiet` that flew alone would cross the position untouched.
#
# WHAT TO READ:
#   events.log   `site CUE ... brgDeg=...` (a BEARING and a POWER, never a range), then
#                `site STATE from=DARK to=SEARCH why="passive cue"` and `site RADIATE`. Every `site`
#                line's time is AFTER the cue, and the position's own search still has to find the
#                target the receiver only pointed at.
#   telemetry_sam.csv  site_cue rising before site_beam0 does
#
# THE COUNTERFACTUAL, MEASURED: the identical file with the `loud` block deleted produces ZERO `site`
# lines, ZERO `site RADIATE` and ZERO launches over the whole 160 s. The cue is the only thing that ever
# switches this position on.
#
# THE TRADE IS THE POINT AND IT CUTS BOTH WAYS: `quiet` bought its silence by having no radar picture at
# all. That is W4's one-line experiment, on the defender's side of the line.
#
# READING RULE: exit 2 = CRASH (`loud` is engaged and hit) is the expected verdict. The measurement is
# the ORDER — cue, then radiate, then track — and that `quiet` is never the reason for any of it.

unit loud
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.40000 6.90000 3000 0.0 400
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode crm
  set rwr on
  wp 46.75000 6.90000 3000 400

unit quiet
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.40000 7.00000 3000 0.0 400
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  wp 46.75000 7.00000 3000 400

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.62000 6.90000 ground 0.0 0
  set emcon hold
  set rounds 3
  set scoot_s 60
